DESCRIPTION >
    Integrations hygiene: count of pageviews missing utm_source, trailing 30d.
    Tenant-scoped; prunes via (site_id, timestamp). Faithful 1:1 port of
    api/routes/integrations.js:28-34 (queryName 'integ_missing_source').
    Typed-column translation: properties.site_id -> site_id, event ->
    event_type, properties.utm_source -> utm_source (typed, String
    Nullable->'direct' on read per §2.6). No JSON-bag fields.
    NOT YET PUSHED — validated read-only via `tb --cloud sql` only.

NODE integ_missing_source_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT count() AS cnt
    FROM events
    WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
      AND event_type = '$pageview'
      AND timestamp >= now() - INTERVAL 30 DAY
      AND (utm_source IS NULL OR utm_source = '')

TYPE endpoint
